Package: TranslatoR
Title: Bilingual Breeding Insight Import-Template Translator
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Josue", "Chinchilla-Vargas",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "josuechinchilla14@gmail.com")
Description: A 'shiny' application built with 'golem' that switches Breeding
    Insight / DeltaBreed import templates between Spanish and English. Each
    import template is a module providing a bilingual field guide, blank
    template downloads, and a converter that swaps the Data-sheet header row
    between languages while leaving all data rows and other worksheets
    untouched.
